id: pm-gh1404
title: Adopt CodeQL 4.38.2 and TruffleHog 3.97.9 immutable scanner updates
description: Integrate newly arrived Dependabot PR 1404 into the existing SDK settings and freshness delivery PR 1402. Update three CodeQL subaction references in lockstep and the TruffleHog scanner pin after independently verifying official tags and more than seven full days of release age. Preserve mandatory scanner behavior and workflow contracts.
